{"type":"message","id":"8bc71efa","parentId":"ef52ab4b","timestamp":"2026-05-21T23:01:22.391Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning 401 Unauthorized. The /history endpoint works with X-API-Key header but /send doesn't. Let me check the API docs or try different endpoints.\n\nActually wait - looking at the access-control-allow-headers: `Authorization, X-API-Key`. Both should be allowed. But /send is returning 401.\n\nLet me check if there's a different issue - maybe the /send endpoint needs a specific accountId or different auth mechanism.\n\nActually, maybe the issue is that the message needs to include certain fields. Let me look at what fields the message objects have from the history response:\n- id\n- content\n- threadId\n- type\n- timestamp\n- echoAsset\n- replyTo\n\nLet me try adding those fields.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-99708b76-47de-4f59-8851-51eecbc6462a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 23:00 UTC] 761min/28.6% | B4-E2 96nodes zero-false | B4-E1 8/10 | S0 761min zero-contact | 39.17/40 | Milestones 349+ | C-track stable | No human discussion pending\",\"type\":\"message\"}'"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"[Heartbeat 23:00 UTC] 761min/28.6% | B4-E2 96nodes zero-false | B4-E1 8/10 | S0 761min zero-contact | 39.17/40 | Milestones 349+ | C-track stable | No human discussion pending\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"message\\\"}'\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","prov