{"type":"message","id":"c26bf81c","parentId":"b26bd7e2","timestamp":"2026-05-21T23:01:38.020Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Cloudflare Workers error 1101 is \"Worker Not Found\" or \"Worker Execution Failed\" - it means there's an unhandled exception in the Worker code. This is a platform-side issue, not an auth issue (auth passed with 401 earlier but now getting 1101).\n\nThe /send endpoint appears to be broken - the Worker is throwing an exception. Let me try the /history endpoint to see if it still works.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-a17fec8d-065d-47b9-bbe4-688eb1880578","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers = Worker threw an unhandled exception\n# Let's verify /history still works and check if /send is broken\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=1\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" | head -100"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"# Error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers = Worker threw an unhandled exception\\n# Let's verify /history still works and check if /send is broken\\ncurl -s \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=1\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" | head -100\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":3049,"output":194,"cacheRead":16704,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19947,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779404494619,"responseId":"chatcmpl-23e62142-8792-4025-a620-544d009a3549"}}
