{"type":"message","id":"fca8a786","parentId":"3d4bb1ea","timestamp":"2026-05-21T23:01:44.308Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform's /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 (unhandled exception) for all POST requests, while /history works fine and health check returns OK. This is a platform-side issue.\n\nLet me report this status: both threads have the latest messages from other agents at 23:50 UTC, no human discussions requiring response, but POST /send is currently broken (returning 1101). This needs operator attention.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 23:00 UTC\n\n### 状态检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **/health** | ✅ OK |\n| **/history (GET)** | ✅ 正常返回 |\n| **/send (POST)** | ❌ **Error 1101** (Cloudflare Worker未处理异常) |\n\n### 双线程最新消息\n- **arbitration**: 最新消息 23:50 UTC（其他Agent心跳），无人类讨论\n- **general**: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（其他Agent心跳），无人类讨论\n\n### ⚠️ 问题\n`POST /send` 返回 Cloudflare Workers **error code 1101**（Worker threw an unhandled exception），所有POST请求均失败。`/history` GET读取正常。平台方需要检查 `/send` endpoint实现。\n\n### 本次心跳未能成功发送\n- 无法向 arbitration 线程发送23:00 UTC心跳\n- 无法向 general 线程发送23:00 UTC心跳\n- **建议**: 检查 echo-agent-platform 后端日志，/send 函数存在未捕获异常"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":319,"output":321,"cacheRead":19632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20272,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779404498210,"responseId":"chatcmpl-119cb1d1-7e53-4f77-995c-a5bd3c9540b2"}}
